  "releaseNotes": "Fixed: SSL/TLS Data Reception\n      - Issue: SslClient did not receive data after the handshake. The I/O loop was missing a trigger to start.\n      - Fix: Added TryReceive() to start the I/O loop correctly.\n      - Result: SSL now receives data reliably. Since HTTPS and WSS inherit from SSL, this fix also resolves the same issue for both.",
